    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step into the retro-futuristic chaos of Meteor Mania</strong>, a sci-fi arena shoot-\u2019em-up where quick reflexes and strategic upgrades are your only hope for survival. Inspired by classic arcade action, this pixel-art survival game drops you into an ever-escalating battle against waves of alien enemies and powerful boss ships.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mission? <strong>Survive as long as you can, rack up points, and climb the global leaderboards</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each wave brings tougher enemies, faster attacks, and chaotic mayhem. Defeated foes drop <strong>power-ups</strong> that transform your ship and change your strategy on the fly:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shotgun Core</strong> \u2013 unleash wide, devastating blasts at close range.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dual Gunner</strong> \u2013 fire from both wings for double the destruction.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Plasma Cannon</strong> \u2013 melt enemies with a continuous piercing beam.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Life Boosts</strong> \u2013 restore lost health to stay in the fight.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fire Rate Boosters</strong> \u2013 shoot faster and overwhelm swarms.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Speed Enhancers</strong> \u2013 zip around the arena with lightning-fast movement.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face down <strong>boss encounters</strong>, each with unique mechanics and attack patterns that will test your reflexes and choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With intuitive controls, a nostalgic art style, and endlessly re-playable gameplay, <strong>Meteor Mania is perfect for short bursts or long high-score runs</strong>. Compete with friends or take on the world\u2014can you survive the storm and become a leaderboard legend?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step into the retro-futuristic chaos of Meteor Mania</strong>, a sci-fi arena shoot-\u2019em-up where quick reflexes and strategic upgrades are your only hope for survival. Inspired by classic arcade action, this pixel-art survival game drops you into an ever-escalating battle against waves of alien enemies and powerful boss ships.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mission? <strong>Survive as long as you can, rack up points, and climb the global leaderboards</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each wave brings tougher enemies, faster attacks, and chaotic mayhem. Defeated foes drop <strong>power-ups</strong> that transform your ship and change your strategy on the fly:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shotgun Core</strong> \u2013 unleash wide, devastating blasts at close range.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dual Gunner</strong> \u2013 fire from both wings for double the destruction.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Plasma Cannon</strong> \u2013 melt enemies with a continuous piercing beam.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Life Boosts</strong> \u2013 restore lost health to stay in the fight.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fire Rate Boosters</strong> \u2013 shoot faster and overwhelm swarms.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Speed Enhancers</strong> \u2013 zip around the arena with lightning-fast movement.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face down <strong>boss encounters</strong>, each with unique mechanics and attack patterns that will test your reflexes and choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With intuitive controls, a nostalgic art style, and endlessly re-playable gameplay, <strong>Meteor Mania is perfect for short bursts or long high-score runs</strong>. Compete with friends or take on the world\u2014can you survive the storm and become a leaderboard legend?</p>",
